==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Team Up|Mankey|71}} from the {{TCG|Team Up}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare print features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Mankey}}.
*'''Focus Fist''' is an attack that first appeared as '''Mega Peck''' on {{TCG ID|Gym Challenge|Blaine's Dodrio|32}} from the {{TCG|Gym Challenge}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

